EviGround

The current source tree contains the EviGround grounding workflow. Its development
workspace previously included SeeGround reproduction code, PointNeXt code and old
experiments; those implementation trees are removed from this revision.

The existing Apache-2.0 LICENSE is retained. Third-party Python libraries and
models retain their own licenses. Nr3D/ReferIt3D annotations and external ScanNet
scene data retain their original terms and attribution requirements.
